// --- Backgrounds -------------------------------------------------------------

// Background palette banks: one per level style for the spot pattern (2 spot,
// 3 rim: dark and close together, so the ball stands out; around the spots
// the backdrop's gradient shows through), and the frame's (1 HUD band, 2
// highlight, 3 pipe, 4 shadow, 5 outline, 6 bolts).
enum { BANK_NAVY, BANK_TEAL, BANK_PLUM, BANK_RUST, BANK_FRAME, BANK_COUNT };

